{"reviewId": "215171944_8bN107fVC", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "经济大周期从繁荣向衰退，最先最根本的表现不是物价，也不是增长，而是“钱”开始变少，变贵，变的难借。这里的钱主要是流通速度变慢了，可能被锁在了少数人手中等等，它没有凭空蒸发，而是不转了，不敢转了，或者被藏起来了。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "713-755", "abstract": "最为现实的问题是，长波的转折点理论上就是流动性的转折点，这与金本位还是美元本位无关。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "215171944_8bN107fVC", "userVid": 215171944, "topics": [], "createTime": 1788242734, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "author": {"userVid": 215171944, "name": "如淑", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-HHSNbS4toXIXDABolQpEAf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "如淑", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "我听不懂你在说什么", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-10", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作爱好者", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 223635575, "name": "我不是洪峰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLkhJn24FKIPM6tRtECknCvPicRYMj65QAU2fh6Apib2IF1Zia3MdJnpUKYzOm1Gx4bnmrskWZEUvdIg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-6-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "人类的行为，秋收冬藏，入冬了", "reviewId": "215171944_8bN107fVC", "commentId": "215171944_8bN107fVC_c223635575